Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.75,0:00:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, that's all for today's class.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you'll be studying\Nfor college exams next year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Katagiri High School"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.37,0:00:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you'll be studying\Nfor college exams next year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,so you won't get to enjoy\Nyour next summer vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out and enjoy the pool\Nor the beach while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why the hell would we\Ninvite a {\i1}teacher {\i0}to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please, Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in going to the\Npool or beach with a bunch of {\i1}guys{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.33,0:00:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,God, they're so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.87,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuda's pretty hot, but he\Nkeeps opening his dumb mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.79,0:00:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a good teacher, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, just ignore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Did something happen\Nbetween you and Yasuda-sensei, Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.04,0:01:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori! Keep your chin up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.04,0:01:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a little-known fact about me:\NI love flat-chested girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So have a little self-confidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how he tried to cheer me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.04,0:01:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I have no idea what\Nhe was trying to do there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.70,0:01:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.87,0:01:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy from another school\Nasked me for your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.08,0:01:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I give it to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.62,0:01:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't have the guts to ask\Nme himself, so no. Turn him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww, again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.33,0:01:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, wanna hit up karaoke on our way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Karaoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.12,0:01:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I got these coupons that expire today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Half off two hours! That's a sweet deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna go, Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.29,0:01:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.62,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I gotta pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}always {\i0}pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.37,0:02:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.50,0:02:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You dropped your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,God, Miyamura sounds so gloomy.\NSame as always, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.33,0:02:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet he's a total otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.41,0:02:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I like {\i1}this {\i0}angle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The "{\i1}so moe{\i0}!" kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he really like, Toru?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.37,0:02:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem like he has\Nany friends we could ask, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.08,0:02:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, gotta run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori's always in a hurry to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably because she's\Ngot a boyfriend or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.25,0:02:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A boyfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, she's pretty and popular.\NI wouldn't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, I'll handle dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.87,0:03:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, no getting out of overtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd better get going...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Lion Room"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.79,0:03:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.66,0:03:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Karaoke"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Karaoke"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.16,0:03:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna hit up that store\Nwe saw in that fashion mag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.58,0:03:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, like, now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have hamburg steak for dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.54,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Horimiya"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"A Tiny Happenstance"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"A Tiny Happenstance"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Overtime {\i1}and {\i0}working on her day off...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Overtime {\i1}and {\i0}working on her day off...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wish she'd learn to say no to people...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.91,0:05:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.95,0:05:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Bleed"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota! What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.83,0:05:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww. Where's your handkerchief, buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.50,0:05:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.12,0:05:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's okay now, so I'm gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was totally ignoring him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.20,0:05:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uhh, I'm so sorry you\Nhad to take care of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.70,0:05:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.41,0:06:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, if you're not in a hurry,\Nwhy don't you come in for a few?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. I have to thank you\Nfor taking care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He got scared by a dog and fell down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for going so far out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, thank {\i1}you {\i0}for treating me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.70,0:06:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is your coffee really bitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a good kid.\NIntroduced himself and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.04,0:06:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, thank you. He's a real\Nhandful most of the time, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.37,0:06:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I'm really impressed that\Nyou take care of all the housework.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected that from you, Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.62,0:06:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}are {\i0}Hori-san, right? In Class 1?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.66,0:06:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, that's me,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.33,0:06:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but wait, you go to my school?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.25,0:06:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in your class. Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be the same person!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori, you're making the\Nweirdest face right now. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.54,0:07:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.12,0:07:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura, can I have a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You want me to come over again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Not me! My little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sota wants 'that cool dude'\Nto come play with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Then I'll pick up\Na picture book for him or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.54,0:07:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. You don't have to\Ngo out of your way or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, okay. Sota'll be really thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.50,0:07:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.91,0:07:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought for sure after yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.20,0:07:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd just avoid being around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.91,0:08:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, yeah, it was a little\Nawkward and freaked me out a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so not like that here at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.41,0:08:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm kinda in the same boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.33,0:08:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't really have\Na reason to avoid you or any...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you blushing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.87,0:08:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I guess I'm just not\Nused to hearing this stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kinda weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.16,0:08:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a nice smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.75,0:08:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You should wear your hair up more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.87,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And lose the glasses, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.37,0:08:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I could, but then they'd see I have piercings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got a lot, too. How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.83,0:08:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine, I think. Four on\Neach ear and one on my lip.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.58,0:08:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's way too many piercings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are a few things I've\Nlearned about Miyamura so far:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I like manga, but I'm not\Ninto all that {\i1}moe {\i0}stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.83,0:08:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not an otaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.25,0:08:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought some cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,His family runs a cake shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it hurt a lot when I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He pierced himself with\Na safety pin back in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.45,0:09:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Oof...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not a very good student.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're incredible, Hori-san!\NYou've got almost straight A's!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't quiet guys with\Nglasses supposed to be smart?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"This Week's Sales"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"This Week's Sales"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.95,0:09:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's times like these when I realize
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"This Week's Sales"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,that my initial impression\Nof him was totally off the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.91,0:09:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that my initial impression\Nof him was totally off the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.20,0:09:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? An ad for the supermarket?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.75,0:09:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Eggs are on sale tomo--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,His lower eyelashes are really long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.37,0:09:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a limited-time sale on eggs\Ntomorrow with no purchase limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.04,0:09:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But it says "only until 4 PM."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as there's no emergency\Ncommittee meeting or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:10:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to buy a whole truckload\Nof eggs on my way home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All committee members,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.50,0:10:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,please report to the AV room after homeroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What great timing...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not giving up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.70,0:10:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...on those eggs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.95,0:10:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hori-s...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Coming over today, right?\NGet me those eggs asap"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.95,0:10:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm supposed to buy them now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have to run in this heat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty minutes left!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take the shortcut!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it's egg time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.62,0:11:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Egg time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, thanks a ton!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.16,0:11:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Those rabid housewives were scary...\NNo more sales for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.62,0:11:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, uh, I ran into\Nsomeone on my way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.95,0:11:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Who?! Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.33,0:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That Yuki girl you hang out with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You ran into her dressed like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.16,0:11:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I don't think she knew it was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.79,0:11:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out, don't spill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.16,0:11:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.20,0:11:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I kinda don't want anyone else\Nto see you like this, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, never mind! Forget I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.87,0:11:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to get out drinks. Is barley tea okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When I get to see you like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,cooking dinner, or getting mad\Nand yelling really loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, the fact that you don't care\Nwhat your hair looks like at home,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.62,0:12:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,or the way you're kinda brawny, in a good way--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.87,0:12:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anyone else\Nto see this side of you, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.50,0:12:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It kinda feels like this moment\Nbelongs to me and only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.95,0:12:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say stuff like that, you dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I have some, too, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.41,0:12:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, how can he say something\Nthat cringey with a straight face?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.58,0:12:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he not realize? Is he that dumb?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,--You dummy. You're such\Na dummy! You big dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'm a dummy...?\N--You dummy. You're such\Na dummy! You big dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,--You dummy! Dummy, dummy, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.79,0:13:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,--My sister can't stop saying "dummy"\Nafter she says it once. Watch.\N--You dummy! Dummy, dummy, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Really?\N--You dummy! Dummy, dummy, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.87,0:13:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dummy, dummy, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.58,0:13:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why're you laughing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.62,0:13:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has a side of them they\Ndon't want anyone to know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't like\Nthe way you are at school,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.54,0:13:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I like this side of you that gets\Nmad and dresses plain at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.54,0:13:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're way cuter like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of us ended up sharing\Nthis "secret self" time with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, whatever, you big dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only gonna get hotter from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.95,0:13:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wearing this jacket all\Nthe time's gonna be torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.16,0:13:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, I'm in trouble!\NWe're gonna be swimming in P.E.!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.45,0:13:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.75,0:13:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with swimming?\NBetter than making us run a marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.95,0:14:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Swimming is way worse!\NThey're gonna see {\i1}everything{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, {\i1}everythi{\i0}--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I do about {\i1}these{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.33,0:14:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes I'm not sure if you're incredibly bold
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.29,0:14:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,or incredibly stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...at least swimming was optional, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.45,0:14:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, for real...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.45,0:14:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But what if we {\i1}do {\i0}have to run a marathon?\NI {\i1}have {\i0}to wear my jacket!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die of heatstroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.91,0:14:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think they're gonna\Nmake us run a marathon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. You see the two of\Nthem together a lot lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I never expected {\i1}him {\i0}to be in the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori, lemme see your notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wanna see, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, fine, but you really need to take your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Popular, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What, uh, what's popular?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.75,0:14:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.45,0:15:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I wish I could\Nget good grades like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.83,0:15:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.12,0:15:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Hori sure have\Nbeen getting along lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.50,0:15:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You two dating?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.95,0:15:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Of course not, that's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The two of you aren't anything alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.95,0:15:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.\NWe wouldn't make a good couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We just don't match up, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Use your words, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't see those two together often.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry--oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.95,0:15:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, do you have a crush on Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,S-So what if I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.20,0:15:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.33,0:15:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So {\i1}that's {\i0}why you always glare\Nat me when I'm talking to Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, yeah, I do! So don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.37,0:16:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Ishikawa-kun, I didn't know\Nyou had a crush on Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.37,0:16:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't announce it to the whole school!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry! Is it still a secret? I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo! What're you guys doing? We gotta go to P.E.!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already gonna be late,\Nso let's take our time heading over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, here's something I've\Nbeen wondering about for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.12,0:16:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing your winter\Nuniform in the middle of summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.41,0:16:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I get cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.00,0:16:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sweating buckets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what it's going\Nto sound like, Ishikawa-kun,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.79,0:16:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but the only person who's seen me\Nwithout a shirt on is Hori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.20,0:16:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, you won't snitch\Non me to a teacher, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no, I wouldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a real pain if they found out...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So please don't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? Are those tattoos?\NWait, they're {\i1}real{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:17:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see why you can't wear\Nour short-sleeved uniform now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.66,0:17:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I totally had you pinned for\Nthe weird, gloomy, otaku type,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but damn, was I wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.50,0:17:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong about otaku,\Nbut everything else is spot on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.83,0:17:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I'm getting a good look\Nat him, he {\i1}does {\i0}have a nice face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.25,0:17:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Though his hair is obnoxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Was P.E. in the gym today?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the kind of face Hori's into?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.04,0:17:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Dude, you have piercings, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.54,0:17:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, next!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a funny guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.12,0:17:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why get inked or pierced if\Nyou're just gonna end up hiding it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.75,0:17:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how you do things\Nin the spur of the moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna keep hiding them,\Nthen I won't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.37,0:17:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I wanna know why you and\NHori-san suddenly got all buddy-buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.83,0:18:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't sudden.\NIt happened a little while back, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I get the feeling\Nshe's just being nice to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not anything more\Nthan friends, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So you don't mind if I ask her out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.45,0:18:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why are you asking for my permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I dunno, just felt like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.25,0:18:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's up to Hori-san, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you skipped P.E., Toru...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.12,0:18:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You had gym duty, too! Instead,\NI had to be the one to clean up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.29,0:18:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I am! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.08,0:18:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You were hanging out with Toru? That's random.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.12,0:18:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. We were just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why're you avoiding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.66,0:18:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.41,0:18:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Look me in the eye when you're talking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.50,0:18:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Did I do something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.66,0:18:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna talk to you later. Is after school okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.70,0:19:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,After school?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san, I'll go pick up Sota for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Go talk with Ishikawa-kun, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.91,0:19:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.50,0:19:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If they ended up dating,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be a huge third wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.70,0:19:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late, Sota!\NI'll start dinner in a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.70,0:19:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.29,0:20:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If she says, "you need to stop\Ncoming over," then that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru told me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.62,0:20:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously tell him you\Ndon't think we're a good match?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha...? Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.41,0:20:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really say that you think I'm,\NI'm just being {\i1}nice {\i0}to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait--What about Ishikawa-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.08,0:20:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about Toru right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.16,0:20:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.00,0:20:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you tell him all that, Miyamura?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really what you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been thinking that the\Nwhole time you've been coming over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.12,0:20:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, just... Ishikawa-kun's right,\NI'm so gloomy and boring,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured I was dragging down\Nyour reputation, or bothering you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's not like I think it's true or anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.16,0:20:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hori-san?! Why--?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.45,0:21:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.83,0:21:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you give\Na crap about my "reputation"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just {\i1}assume {\i0}stuff without even asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.79,0:21:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever say something\Nlike that again, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.70,0:21:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Hori-san. I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remembering what you said
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,makes me so mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--? Hori-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.87,0:21:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you stopped coming over, Miyamura,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.41,0:21:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,--who'd wake me up when\NI fell asleep watching a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,--H-Hey--\N--who'd wake me up when\NI fell asleep watching a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.08,0:21:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,--who'd wake me up when\NI fell asleep watching a movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.29,0:21:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,--Or eat your portion of dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Or eat your portion of dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.83,0:21:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--I'd have food left over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.87,0:21:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,--I'd have food left over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Toru?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.91,0:21:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww. He seems really sweet, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You're creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a crush on him or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.41,0:21:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't {\i1}you {\i0}guys date?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't think we'd make a good couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your first reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"You Wear More Than One Face"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.91,0:23:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Morning, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.45,0:23:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, yesterday, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.04,0:23:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say it out loud, Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.37,0:23:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a sweet guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.41,0:23:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.62,0:23:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea. Maybe he's getting asked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.79,0:23:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's doing the asking?
